### ================================================================
### Tenant Products — run in this order
### ================================================================

### 1. List all products
GET {{CRM.api_HostAddress}}/api/tenant/1/products
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Create a product
POST {{CRM.api_HostAddress}}/api/tenant/1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productCode": "PROD004",
  "productName": "Fourth Product",
  "unitPrice": 249.99,
  "isActive": true
}

###

### 3. List all products again5
GET {{CRM.api_HostAddress}}/api/tenant/1/products
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Get product by ID (use actual ID from step 2)
GET {{CRM.api_HostAddress}}/api/tenant/1/products/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Delete product by ID (use actual ID from step 2)
DELETE {{CRM.api_HostAddress}}/api/tenant/1/products/1

###

