### ================================================================
### Lab 5 — Phase 2 — Tenant Customers
### ================================================================

### 1. List tenant customers in Tenant A (companyId = 1)
GET {{CRM.api_HostAddress}}/api/tenant/1/tenant-customers
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Create tenant customer in Tenant A
POST {{CRM.api_HostAddress}}/api/tenant/1/tenant-customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerCode": "CUST001",
  "customerName": "Juan Dela Cruz",
  "contactNumber": "09171234567",
  "emailAddress": "juan@example.com",
  "address": "Davao City",
  "isActive": true,
  "createdAt": "2026-09-09T16:45:00"
}

###

### 3. List tenant customers in Tenant A again — should show Juan
GET {{CRM.api_HostAddress}}/api/tenant/1/tenant-customers
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. List tenant customers in Tenant B (companyId = 3)
GET {{CRM.api_HostAddress}}/api/tenant/3/tenant-customers
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Create tenant customer in Tenant B
POST {{CRM.api_HostAddress}}/api/tenant/3/tenant-customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerCode": "CUST001",
  "customerName": "Maria Santos",
  "contactNumber": "09181234567",
  "emailAddress": "maria@example.com",
  "address": "Cebu City",
  "isActive": true,
  "createdAt": "2026-09-09T16:56:00"
}

###

### 6. List tenant customers in Tenant B again — should show Maria
GET {{CRM.api_HostAddress}}/api/tenant/3/tenant-customers
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Multi-tenant proof — Tenant A shows only Juan
GET {{CRM.api_HostAddress}}/api/tenant/1/tenant-customers
Accept: application/json

### 

### ================================================================
### Lab 5 — Phase 3 — Suppliers
### ================================================================

### 1. List suppliers in Tenant A (companyId = 1)
GET {{CRM.api_HostAddress}}/api/tenant/1/suppliers
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Create supplier in Tenant A
POST {{CRM.api_HostAddress}}/api/tenant/1/suppliers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierCode": "SUP001",
  "supplierName": "Davao Tech Supply",
  "contactPerson": "Carlos Reyes",
  "contactNumber": "09175551234",
  "emailAddress": "sales@davaotechsupply.com",
  "address": "Davao City",
  "isActive": true,
  "createdAt": "2026-09-10T09:00:00"
}

###

### 3. List suppliers in Tenant B (companyId = 3)
GET {{CRM.api_HostAddress}}/api/tenant/3/suppliers
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Create supplier in Tenant B
POST {{CRM.api_HostAddress}}/api/tenant/3/suppliers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierCode": "SUP001",
  "supplierName": "Cebu Office Supply",
  "contactPerson": "Ana Lim",
  "contactNumber": "09186667777",
  "emailAddress": "sales@cebuofficesupply.com",
  "address": "Cebu City",
  "isActive": true,
  "createdAt": "2026-09-10T13:20:00"
}

###

### 5. List suppliers in Tenant B again — should show Cebu Office Supply only
GET {{CRM.api_HostAddress}}/api/tenant/3/suppliers
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Multi-tenant proof — Tenant A shows only Davao Tech Supply
GET {{CRM.api_HostAddress}}/api/tenant/1/suppliers
Accept: application/json

